        "description": "The sole source subfigure has labelled O at bottom-right, A at bottom-left, B at left-middle, C above/right of B, D above/right of C, E at top-right. Arrows O->A->B->C->D->E retain all five bends. Resultant O->E points upward/slightly right. All six letters remain; no numerical values, grid, axes, or dot markers.",
